#==============================================================================================
#
#   interpolation_1 - CSS interpolation: raw values, keywords, discrete values, scale,
#                     filters, translate and rotate
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/CSS/Interpolation.cpp (lines 1-532), by region p4a: the
#       interpolation of raw numbers, integers and vectors (interpolate_raw's instantiations),
#       resolving initial/unset/inherit before interpolating, discrete interpolation, and the
#       interpolation of the scale property, of filter functions and filter value lists, of
#       the translate property, quaternion slerp and the rotate property. The C++ function-
#       local statics (the identity scale, translate and rotate values) are made once in the
#       C heap (DESIGN.md §3.3 rule 7). Parts 2-6 have the grid tracks and interpolate_property,
#       the transforms, box shadows and numeric mixes, interpolate_value_impl, and composition.
